   "cell_type": "raw",
   "source": [
    "{\n",
    " \"cells\": [\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"# K Language - Interactive Constraint Programming\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"This notebook demonstrates the K declarative constraint programming language.\\n\",\n",
    "    \"K models are solved using the Z3 SMT solver.\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"## Getting Started\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"Use `%help` to see available magic commands.\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"code\",\n",
    "   \"execution_count\": null,\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"outputs\": [],\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"%help\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"## Example 1: Simple Constraints\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"Let's define a simple constraint problem: find integers x and y where their sum is 10 and x < y.\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"code\",\n",
    "   \"execution_count\": null,\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"outputs\": [],\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"x : Int\\n\",\n",
    "    \"y : Int\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"req x + y = 10\\n\",\n",
    "    \"req x < y\\n\",\n",
    "    \"req x > 0\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"## Example 2: Classes and Objects\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"K supports object-oriented modeling with classes.\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"code\",\n",
    "   \"execution_count\": null,\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"outputs\": [],\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"%reset\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"code\",\n",
    "   \"execution_count\": null,\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"outputs\": [],\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"class Point {\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    x : Real\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    y : Real\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    \\n\",\n",
    "    \"    req x >= 0.0\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    req y >= 0.0\\n\",\n",
    "    \"}\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"p1 : Point\\n\",\n",
    "    \"p2 : Point\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"-- Distance constraint: p1 and p2 are 5 units apart\\n\",\n",
    "    \"req (p2.x - p1.x)*(p2.x - p1.x) + (p2.y - p1.y)*(p2.y - p1.y) = 25.0\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"-- p1 is at origin\\n\",\n",
    "    \"req p1.x = 0.0\\n\",\n",
    "    \"req p1.y = 0.0\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"## Example 3: Optimization\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"K supports optimization objectives with `minimize` and `maximize`.\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"code\",\n",
    "   \"execution_count\": null,\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"outputs\": [],\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"%reset\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"code\",\n",
    "   \"execution_count\": null,\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"outputs\": [],\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"cost : Int\\n\",\n",
    "    \"quality : Int\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"req cost >= 0\\n\",\n",
    "    \"req cost <= 100\\n\",\n",
    "    \"req quality >= 0\\n\",\n",
    "    \"req quality <= 100\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"-- Quality depends on cost\\n\",\n",
    "    \"req quality <= cost / 2 + 20\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"-- We want at least 40 quality\\n\",\n",
    "    \"req quality >= 40\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"-- Minimize cost\\n\",\n",
    "    \"minimize cost\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"## Example 4: Collections\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"K supports Sets, Sequences, and other collection types.\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"code\",\n",
    "   \"execution_count\": null,\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"outputs\": [],\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"%reset\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"code\",\n",
    "   \"execution_count\": null,\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"outputs\": [],\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"class Item {\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    weight : Int\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    value : Int\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    \\n\",\n",
    "    \"    req weight > 0\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    req value > 0\\n\",\n",
    "    \"}\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"item1 : Item\\n\",\n",
    "    \"item2 : Item\\n\",\n",
    "    \"item3 : Item\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"-- Total weight constraint (knapsack-like)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"req item1.weight + item2.weight + item3.weight <= 100\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"-- Maximize total value\\n\",\n",
    "    \"maximize item1.value + item2.value + item3.value\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"## Loading External Files\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"You can load existing K files using the `%load` magic command:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"```\\n\",\n",
    "    \"%load path/to/model.k\\n\",\n",
    "    \"```\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"## Next Steps\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- Explore the K examples in `src/examples/`\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- Read the K documentation\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- Try modeling your own constraint problems!\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  }\n",
    " ],\n",
